# PROVENANCE: Synthetic cross-binding regression for finite replay resets.
name: finite random source resets unread replay bytes
case-id: finite-random-reset
origin: synthetic
feature-version: 6
source: generated replay-source reset regression
requires: iso7816-auth
uid: 04223344556677
picc-generation: EV3
picc-storage: 4096
picc-key-settings-1: 0F
picc-key-settings-2: 01
picc-auth-mode: AES
picc-key-len: 16
picc-auth-commands: 23

random-source finite
scan
inject-random 11 11 11 11 11 11 11 11 11 11 11 11 11 11 11 11
exchange iso-apdu 0084000008 => 11111111111111119000
random-source finite
inject-random AA AA AA AA AA AA AA AA
exchange iso-apdu 0084000008 => AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA9000
field-off
